{%- comment -%}
  Section « Avis produit » — Gus & Frost
  Affiche les avis clients liés à la fiche produit via le metafield custom.avis
  (liste de références vers le metaobject « avis »). Affichage seul (MVP).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign avis_list = product.metafields.custom.avis.value
  assign total = 0
  assign count = 0
  for avis in avis_list
    assign n = avis.note.value | plus: 0
    assign total = total | plus: n
    assign count = count | plus: 1
  endfor
  assign average = 0
  if count > 0
    assign average = total | times: 1.00 | divided_by: count
  endif
  assign avg_pct = average | times: 20
-%}

{%- style -%}
  .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<style>
  .gf-avis__wrapper { max-width: 78rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .gf-avis__heading { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .gf-avis__summary {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2.4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.12);
  }
  .gf-avis__avg-num { font-size: 4.2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }
  .gf-avis__avg-den { font-size: 1.6rem; opacity: 0.55; }
  .gf-avis__count { font-size: 1.5rem; opacity: 0.8; }
  .gf-stars {
    position: relative; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;
    line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-size: 2rem;
  }
  .gf-stars--sm { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .gf-stars__bg { color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.2); }
  .gf-stars__fg {
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; overflow: hidden;
    color: #f5b301; width: var(--pct, 0%);
  }
  .gf-avis__list { display: grid; gap: 2rem; }
  .gf-avis__item {
    padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.12);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }
  .gf-avis__item-head {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .gf-avis__badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1a7f4b;
    background: rgba(26, 127, 75, 0.1); padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 2rem;
  }
  .gf-avis__item-title { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
  .gf-avis__meta { font-size: 1.3rem; opacity: 0.65; margin-left: auto; }
  .gf-avis__body { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .gf-avis__empty { text-align: center; opacity: 0.7; font-size: 1.5rem; }
</style>

<div class="color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient">
  <div class="page-width section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
    <div class="gf-avis__wrapper">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="gf-avis__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if count > 0 -%}
        <div class="gf-avis__summary">
          <span class="gf-avis__avg-num">{{ average | round: 1 | replace: '.', ',' }}</span>
          <span class="gf-avis__avg-den">/&nbsp;5</span>
          <span class="gf-stars" style="--pct: {{ avg_pct }}%;" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="gf-stars__bg">★★★★★</span>
            <span class="gf-stars__fg">★★★★★</span>
          </span>
          <span class="gf-avis__count">{{ count }}&nbsp;avis</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gf-avis__list">
          {%- for avis in avis_list -%}
            {%- assign note = avis.note.value | plus: 0 -%}
            {%- assign item_pct = note | times: 20 -%}
            <div class="gf-avis__item">
              <div class="gf-avis__item-head">
                <span class="gf-stars gf-stars--sm" style="--pct: {{ item_pct }}%;" aria-label="{{ note }} sur 5">
                  <span class="gf-stars__bg">★★★★★</span>
                  <span class="gf-stars__fg">★★★★★</span>
                </span>
                {%- if section.settings.show_verified_badge and avis.verifie.value -%}
                  <span class="gf-avis__badge">✔&nbsp;Achat vérifié</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if avis.date_avis.value != blank -%}
                  <span class="gf-avis__meta">{{ avis.date_avis.value | date: '%d/%m/%Y' }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              {%- if avis.titre.value != blank -%}
                <p class="gf-avis__item-title">{{ avis.titre.value | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <p class="gf-avis__body">{{ avis.contenu.value | newline_to_br }}</p>
              {%- if avis.auteur.value != blank -%}
                <p class="gf-avis__meta" style="margin-left:0;margin-top:1rem;">— {{ avis.auteur.value | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Le bloc JSON-LD qui se trouvait ici emettait un second "@type": "Product"
          reduit a name + aggregateRating + review : sans image, sans description et
          sans offers. Sur le gabarit product.tapis-lechage (qui n'inclut pas
          main-product) c'etait le SEUL balisage produit de la page — d'ou le
          « champ image manquant » critique remonte par la Search Console.

          Il publiait de surcroit trois avis de DEMONSTRATION comme s'ils etaient
          reels, ce que les regles Google interdisent.

          L'affichage visuel des avis, lui, est conserve tel quel ci-dessus. Le
          balisage des avis sera rebranche dans snippets/gf-product-schema.liquid
          le jour ou de vrais avis clients existeront.
        {%- endcomment -%}

      {%- else -%}
        {%- if request.design_mode -%}
          <p class="gf-avis__empty">Aucun avis lié à ce produit pour l'instant. Ajoute des avis dans <strong>Contenu → Métaobjets → Avis produit</strong>, puis relie-les via le champ <strong>Avis clients</strong> de la fiche produit.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Avis produit",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Titre", "default": "Avis clients" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_verified_badge", "label": "Afficher le badge « Achat vérifié »", "default": true },
    { "type": "color_scheme", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Jeu de couleurs", "default": "background-1" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Marges" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "label": "Marge haute", "default": 48 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "label": "Marge basse", "default": 48 }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Avis produit" } ],
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["product"] }
}
{% endschema %}
